            "text": "<p>Soil feeds the world, holds water, and stabilizes the climate.<br/><br/>Yet a century of industrial agriculture has crippled the microbial communities that make soil productive, degrading 75% of the world's agricultural soils. Yield growth rates are plateauing while erosion and toxic runoff from synthetic fertilizers accelerate.<br/><br/>Oath Biome returns life to depleted soils — replenishing the microbiome with diverse communities of naturally occurring microorganisms, each selected for a proven role in restoring soil function. Our Microbial Discovery Engine uses whole-genome sequencing, advanced bioinformatics, and artificial intelligence to compose Oath Soil Life: non-GMO bacterial and fungal consortia delivered as a wettable powder. <br/><br/>The result: measurable yield gains and financial benefits across every scale of agriculture — from smallholder farms in the Global South to the most advanced commercial operations — while reducing water and fertilizer inputs and enhancing carbon sequestration.</p>"
          }
        }
